# Branch naming

All branches must follow the pattern:

```
KAN-{ticket-number}-{short-description}
```

## Rules

1. Always prefix with the Jira ticket key (`KAN-{number}`)
2. Short description: lowercase, hyphen-separated, 2-4 words
3. No spaces, no uppercase, no special characters

## Examples

- `KAN-4-adapter-factory`
- `KAN-5-analyze-endpoint`
- `KAN-6-magiccon-parser`

## When creating a branch

Follow the full **new task workflow** in `new-task-workflow.mdc` (sync prod → Jira ticket → branch).

Branch pattern only:

```powershell
& "C:\Program Files\Git\cmd\git.exe" checkout -b KAN-{n}-{description}
```

Always create the branch from an up-to-date `1-production`.
